            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per confrontare se due numeri sono uguali, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di uguaglianza</strong>, <code>==</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"python\"><content><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per confrontare se due numeri sono uguali, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di uguaglianza</strong>, <code>==</code>.</p><p>Completa un confronto tra due numeri uguali.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>, seguito da <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
