            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo gli stessi numeri con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>10</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo gli stessi numeri con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>True</code>.</p><p>Confronta se <code>10</code> è uguale a <code>10</code> in modo che il codice stampi <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>10</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 76927,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo numeri diversi con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>False</code>. Come nel confronto tra <code>9</code> e <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>9 == 10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo numeri diversi con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>False</code>.</p><p>Scegli il confronto tra <code>9</code> e <code>10</code> che stampa <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10 == 10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 == 9\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>9 == 10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
