          {
            "title": "Inequality operator",
            "id": 76877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se un numero non è uguale a un altro numero, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di disuguaglianza</strong>, <code>!=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se un numero non è uguale a un altro numero, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di disuguaglianza</strong>, <code>!=</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi l'operatore in modo che il confronto tra <code>1</code> e <code>10</code> stampi <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Inequality operator",
            "id": 76873,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare il risultato di un confronto con l'operatore di disuguaglianza in una variabile, come qui, dove memorizzeremo il confronto <code>1 != 2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare il risultato di un confronto in una variabile.</p><p>Memorizza in <code>result</code> se <code>1</code> non è uguale a <code>2</code>, in modo che il codice stampi <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Result ==",
            "id": 76875,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili possono memorizzare anche il risultato dei confronti di uguaglianza, ad esempio <code>result = 1 == 2</code>. </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>result</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili possono memorizzare anche il risultato dei confronti di uguaglianza.</p><p>Memorizza in <code>result</code> se <code>1</code> è uguale a <code>2</code>, in modo che il codice stampi <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>result</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
